  "details": "I am experiencing this strange behavior on some avatars with large or complicated menu systems. When you try to open some specific submenu it won't do anything, or if you open some specific puppet menu it will very briefly flash it open and then close it. In some instances I have had a submenu open and then after a few seconds it will close itself back to the previous menu without any additional input. \n\nI have experienced this on at least two different avatars, one of my own with gogo beyond, and one public with lots of outfits and options.",
